fixture door_enemies_belong_to_their_room
doc docs/adr/0014: a room's enemies stay behind when Ash leaves it and start fresh on the way back in: door_a's 10 hp dummy is killed, door_b has its own 77 hp dummy, and back in door_a the dummy stands again at its marker with 10 hp
room test/door_a
spawn 1110 416
frames 60
input
  0 R attack
  1..3 R
  4..21 R
  22..59 L
end
expect
  at 2 event.kill=1
  at 13 room=test_door_a enemy.hp=0
  mark there 1..30 event.room=1
  at there room=test_door_b enemy.hp=77 enemy.x=600u
  mark back 23..59 event.room=1
  at back room=test_door_a enemy.hp=10 enemy.x=1150u enemy.state=idle
end
